# Nothing local reaches an image: no secrets, no build output, no dependencies.
# Each image installs from the lockfile and builds from source.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
packages/contracts/broadcast
packages/contracts/cache
packages/contracts/out
.git

# The bounty demo videos are for GitHub viewers, not for any image.
bounty
